<title>USA: Newell completes purchase from Rubbermaid.</title>
<headline>Newell completes purchase from Rubbermaid.</headline>
<dateline>FREEPORT, Ill. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newell Co and Rubbermaid Inc said Friday Newell completed the acquisition of the office products business of Rubbermaid.</p>
<p>In May, Rubbermaid said it agreed to sell the unit for $246.5 million. The business had 1996 sales of $162 million.</p>
<p>Newell provides staple consumer products, and Rubbermaid provides consumer and commercial products.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
